:4,"text_representativeness":0.9423904418945312,"text_excerpt":"I am a Walgreens man when it comes to my drugstores. Don't get me wrong, I am all about locally owned and operated, but unfortunately, that locally owned and operated drugstore in uptown kind of sucks. So now I use Walgreens. I used to use the one on Claiborne, which is fairly awful. It's filled with mostly rude and apathetic staff. So when I switched to the one on Magazine, I was shocked about how nice and helpful everyone was. The pharmacy staff was great. The line was fairly long, but they move people in quickly and politely. When it was my turn, they were efficient and nice. Very pleasant experience. The store itself seems pretty nice. I only browsed around for a few moments before pe..."},{"business_id":"8g4lWyEEz4sZaPU3Y4LGww","review_id":"A04J1BONMIfWDKY285Xvgg","date":"2019-04-16T18:21:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.939300537109375,"text_excerpt":"As far as a Walgreens goes this place is great. It's a relatively new location (few years) so everything is shiny and new. The cosmetics aisles are a pleasure to stroll through, whether looking for something in particular or just wasting time. The pharmacy is great too, there's a drive through window for convenience. Parking lot behind Magazine Street with a back entrance as well as an entrance on Magazine Street. I've picked up photos I've ordered online, gotten a passport photo and picked up any and all essentials I've needed. Very convenient store and location for my day to day life."},{"business_id":"8g4lWyEEz4sZaPU3Y4LGww","review_id":"6KAwsrqIth9rf9TYIrVvUA","date":"2020-03-11T04:58:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253571033477783,"text_excerpt":"This is my neighborhood Walgreens within walking distance and I always have a pleasant experience. They have parking in the back which is perfect since the neighborhood charges for street parking. You can utilize the drive-thru pharmacy but what I appreciate most is the customer service here and the wide variety of items available. They're open fairly late and take advantage of the register near the drinks and fridges!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8g4lWyEEz4sZaPU3Y4LGww","photo_id":"HLl-seC5RJ2kGp_SEZdKvA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HLl-seC5RJ2kGp_SEZdKvA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595360517501831},{"business_id":"8g4lWyEEz4sZaPU3Y4LGww","photo_id":"8gGS-boMfJ6EgbRiX39iSA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8gGS-boMfJ6EgbRiX39iSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595359325408936}]},"notebook_case":null}
